<title>ITALY: Italy October producer prices rise 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy October producer prices rise 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian producer price data for October.</p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES	   Oct 96    Sept 96	Oct 95</p>
<p>    Year/year change	  +0.4 pct  +0.2 pct     +7.9 pct</p>
<p>    Month/month change	+0.2 pct  +0.2 pct	0.0 pct</p>
<p>    Index (base 1990=100)   124.4     124.1	  123.9</p>
</text>
